OL,3,GNEWSAContractor killed in temporary
OL,4,Aroadworks crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne man has died and another has been
OL,7,Finjured in a crash at temporary
OL,8,Froadworks where contractors were
OL,9,Ferecting telegraph poles.
OL,11,FLancashire Police said a tractor, a van
OL,12,Fand a lorry were involved in the
OL,13,Fcollision on Rochdale Road in
OL,14,FEdenfield, close to the junction of
OL,15,FBridgemills, Rochdale Road and Plunge
OL,16,FRoad, just after 11:20 GMT on Monday.
OL,18,FA site worker, aged in his 60s, died at
OL,19,Fthe scene, while a second worker, a man
OL,20,Fin his 30s, was taken to hospital with
OL,21,Finjuries not believed to be
OL,22,Flife-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
