OL,3,GNEWSAContractor killed in temporary
OL,4,Aroadworks crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have asked for anyone who
OL,7,Fwitnessed the crash or who may have
OL,8,Fseen a green tractor towing a black
OL,9,Ftrailer in the area around the time of
OL,10,Fthe collision to contact them.
